meta {
  name: abha-enrol
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  Create a new ABHA with Aadhaar OTP (M1, journeys 1 and 2).
  Run the requests in order. Each step needs the `txnId` of the step before it.
  The caller needs the Care permission `can_create_patient`.

  Warning: Aadhaar and OTP values are personal data. Keep them in the secret variables.
}
